ельцем объектов.\n\nObject Spawning: Инструменты для создания множества объектов.\n\nCleanup Utility: Функция для удаления созданных или выбранных объектов для оптимизации.\n\nTargeting System: Система для выбора объектов или местоположений в игре для применения функций скрипта.\n\nMulti-Lang: Поддержка русского и английского интерфейса.\n\n🇺🇸 Description (EN)\n\nTitle: Final Tabbed Object System V3\n\nDescription: A versatile script for advanced interaction with objects within a game environment. Provides tools for object management and network properties.\n\nKey Features:\nVortex: A system allowing objects to be organized around a chosen point with customizable parameters.\n\nNetwork Ownership Control: Functions for managing the network owner of objects.\n\nObject Spawning: Tools for creating multiple objects.\n\nCleanup Utility: Function for removing created or selected objects for optimization.\n\nTargeting System: A system for selecting objects or locations in the game to apply the script's functions.\n\nDual Language: Supports both RU and EN localized interfaces.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet('https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SPEHICK/1/refs/heads/main/flinggame'))()","owner":{"_id":"6902374defa5e73a9616809f","username":"Speh1k","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6902374defa5e73a9616809f-1761752969084.jpg","status":"offline","id":"6902374defa5e73a9616809f","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":1786,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/rbx-a01d73a5913cce701164502bf9ed9818-eb707ef6a20c.png","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-02-01T22:07:06.913Z","keyLink":"","executes":160,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"697fce8a87d3cdd14efc894a","editBy":{"_id":"6902374defa5e73a9616809f","username":"Speh1k","status":"offline","id":"6902374defa5e73a9616809f"},"mes